  "instructions": [
    "Mix all ingredients together in a bowl to form a smooth batter.",
    "Let batter rest for 30 minutes.",
    "Heat a non-stick skillet or a cast-iron skillet over medium heat.",
    "Brush the skillet with a little oil.",
    "Pour 1/4 cup of batter into the skillet and tilt to spread evenly.",
    "Cook for 2 minutes or until the bottom is lightly browned.",
    "Flip the pancake and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Transfer the pancake to a cedar plank.",
    "Garnish with additional scallions, bean sprouts, and yuzu wedges.",
    "Serve immediately.",
    "Repeat with remaining batter.",
    "Serve hot with fresh herbs and chilies on the side."
